!}
face-image: img/Jozef-Pilsudski-Polish-soldiers.webp

= Presidential Election

The Presidential Election is to be held now

The absence of a candidate for the **<span style="color: #CCC;">Pol</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">ish</span>** moderates leaves behind a vacuum, many parties supporting Piłsudski are scrambling to push a candidate to fill the gap left behind by Piłsudski.

- @who

@who
title: Who will be the successor of Piłsudski?

Without a unifying figure, the ChZJN might win the presidency

- @witos

@witos
title: Piłsudski proposes Witos as a candidate
face-image: img/portraits/WitosWincenty.jpeg

To ensure that the Sejm and Senat are united against a National Democrats (ChZJN) Presidency, Piłsudski proposes another unity figure for the **<span style="color: #CCC;">Pol</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">ish</span>** moderates which is Wincenty Witos, leader of the PSL-P, and Former Prime Minister. but Witos refuses.

- @narutowicz

@narutowicz
title: Piłsudski proposes Narutowicz as a candidate
face-image: img/Narutowicz_Pilsudski.jpg

To ensure that the Sejm and Senat are united against a National Democrats (ChZJN) Presidency, Piłsudski proposes another unity figure for the **<span style="color: #CCC;">Pol</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">ish</span>** moderates which is Gabriel Narutowicz, a non-partisan candidate, closely aligned with Piłsudski, Formed Minister of Public Works and Current Minister of Foreign Affairs.

- @narutoyay
  
@narutoyay
title: Narutowicz Accepts
face-image: img/portraits/NarutowiczGabriel.jpg

With Narutowicz nominated to replace Piłsudski can he expect the Polish Moderates throw their support for him?

For better or worse, Narutowicz candidacy is only supported by the PSL-L and PSL-W.

- @candidate

@candidate
title: View the other running candidates

- @zamoyski
- @courtenay
- @wojciechowski
- @communist

@zamoyski
title: Maurycy Zamoyski, a non-partisan candidate fielded by the ChZJN. Largest estate and the biggest land owner. Serving as the **<span style="color: #CCC;">Pol</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">ish</span>** envoy to **<span style="color: #000091;">Pa</span><span style="color: #CCC;">r</span><span style="color: #E1000F;">is</span>**.
on-arrival: candidate += 1
go-to: candidate
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/portraits/ZamoyskiMaurycy.jpg

His candidacy is supported by the ChZJN.

@courtenay
title: Jan Baudouin de Courtenay
on-arrival: candidate += 1
go-to: candidate
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/portraits/CourtenayJan.jpg

His candidacy is supported by the BMN and Other minority parties.

@wojciechowski
title: Stanisław Wojciechowski
on-arrival: candidate += 1
go-to: candidate
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/portraits/WojciechowskiStanisław.jpg

Wincenty Witos was perceived as a person communicating with the right and not paying attention to the interests of rural villages. Hence, Stanisław Wojciechowski was fielded as a compromise candidate representing the Centrist and Moderates of the PSL-P.

His candidacy is supported by the PSL-P and NPR.

@communist
title: How about the Communists?
view-if: candidate >= 3

The Communist delegates have decided to Boycott the Presidential Election.

- @pps

@pps
title: So, what is our decision? Should we run our own candidate?

- @daszynski: Run Ignacy Daszyński of the PPS.
- @narutowicz: Support Narutowicz.
- @wojciechowski: Support Wojciechowski of the PSL-P.





